<section class="wf-hero"><div class="wf-grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wf-w wf-hero-g"><div class="wf-hero-t"><p class="wf-tag">Your weekend waffle kitchen</p><h1>Every square<br>a little <span>pocket</span><br>of joy.</h1><p class="wf-lead">Waffles is a friendly guide to making better waffles at home. Scale a batter for any crowd, time your iron perfectly and learn why some waffles shatter while others go soft.</p>
<div class="wf-hero-a"><a class="wf-btn" href="#batter">Scale a batter</a><a class="wf-btn wf-btn-o" href="#iron">Time my iron</a></div><ul class="wf-st"><li><b data-count="4">0</b>squares deep</li><li><b data-count="190">0</b>&deg;C sweet spot</li><li><b data-count="2">0</b>free tools</li></ul></div>
