<section class="wf-s" id="batter"><div class="wf-w wf-bt-g"><div class="wf-card wf-bt"><p class="wf-tag">Tool one</p><h2 class="rv">Waffle batter scaler</h2><p class="wf-p">Choose a style and how many waffles you need. We scale a reliable base recipe and show it in cups or grams.</p>
<div class="wf-chips" id="bt-s" role="group" aria-label="Waffle style"><button type="button" class="on" data-v="0">Buttermilk</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Belgian (yeasted)</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Crispy cornstarch</button></div>
<div class="wf-row"><label for="bt-n">Waffles</label><div class="wf-step"><button type="button" id="bt-m" aria-label="Fewer">&minus;</button><output id="bt-v">8</output><button type="button" id="bt-p" aria-label="More">+</button></div><div class="wf-units" role="group" aria-label="Units"><button type="button" class="on" data-u="c">Cups</button><button type="button" data-u="g">Grams</button></div></div><input type="range" id="bt-n" min="2" max="24" value="8" class="wf-rng">
