<section class="wf-s wf-tps"><div class="wf-w"><div class="wf-tps-h"><h2 class="rv">Toppings worth waking up for</h2><figure class="wf-strip"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1785306150651-bdf0cb0085ac?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=260&q=75" alt="syrup drizzling over a waffle in black and white" width="900" height="260" loading="lazy"></figure></div><div class="wf-tps-g stg"><article class="wf-tp rv"><div class="wf-tp-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1785188719488-5cfdcc4474dc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=480&h=480&q=75" alt="a waffle with mixed berries, cream and powdered sugar" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy"></div><h3>Berry patch</h3><p>Mixed berries, softly whipped cream and a snow of powdered sugar.</p></article><article class="wf-tp rv"><div class="wf-tp-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1673646961362-659b4680b9ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=480&h=480&q=75" alt="a waffle with whipped cream and strawberries" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy"></div><h3>Classic strawberry</h3><p>Sliced strawberries and cream: the brunch everyone remembers.</p></article><article class="wf-tp rv"><div class="wf-tp-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789325202215-e7e5993fb007?auto=format&fit=crop&w=480&h=480&q=75" alt="a waffle with ice cream and chocolate sauce" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy"></div><h3>Sundae waffle</h3><p>A scoop of ice cream melting into warm squares, chocolate on top.</p></article></div></div></section>

